{"type":"message","message":{"id":"gen-1775332826-0pLK5eWujfoQWGkourM8","role":"assistant","created":1775332837,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see now that the data I'm looking at is from the October 1969 Treasury Bulletin, which contains data up to August 1969 and some early 1970 data (like January 1970 in the Federal fiscal operations section). \n\nLooking at the structure, the Treasury Bulletin issue for October 1969 contains monthly data, but it seems to include data only up to the current fiscal year (1969) plus some months in 1970 for certain tables. I need data for January of each year from 1969 to 1980.\n\nLooking at the manifest, there are different bulletins referenced for each year:\n- January 1970 (page 32)\n- January 1971 (page 24) \n- January 1972 (page 32)\n- January 1973 (page 38)\n- January 1974 (page 37)\n- January 1975 (page 28)\n- January 1976 (page 27)\n- January 1977 (page 27)\n- January 1978 (page 31)\n- January 1979 (page 29)\n- January 1980 (page 30)\n\nBut all these seem to be extracted from a single file `treasury_bulletin_1969_10` which appears to be a consolidated/aggregated file containing multiple bulletins. \n\nLet me look more carefully at the extracted data. Looking at page 32, I found:\n- 1969-January: Total = 374,443\n\nThis is from Table FD-1 which has \"Total outstanding\" including public debt securities and agency securities. This appears to be the gross federal debt.\n\nWait - looking at the table more carefully:\n- The columns are: Total outstanding, Public debt securities, Agency securities, Government accounts (Total, Public debt securities, Agency securities), IMF & International lending organizations, The public (Total, Public debt securities, Agency securities).\n\nSo the \"Total outstanding\" column appears to be the gross federal debt.\n\n\nI'm noticing that the data is actually scattered across different months and years in a single consolidated file. The 1969 issue seems to contain information from multiple time periods, with January 1969 data embedded within the October 1969 bulletin. I'll need to carefully trace through the various tables to locate the specific January figures for each year.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_b3a2f6279301486c9700a18a","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"January 1970\\|January 1971\\|January 1972\\|January 1973\\|January 1974\\|January 1975\\|January 1976\\|January 1977\\|January 1978\\|January 1979\\|January 1980\" /app/resources/treasury_bulletin_1969_10.txt | head -40"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
